@startuml
title RF57 — All-Star · Máquina de estados: AllStarEvent.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "VOTING" as VOTING
state "ROSTERS_SET" as ROSTERS_SET
state "SKILLS" as SKILLS
state "GAME" as GAME
state "DONE" as DONE
[*] --> VOTING
VOTING --> ROSTERS_SET : votação fecha
ROSTERS_SET --> ROSTERS_SET : substitui lesionado
ROSTERS_SET --> SKILLS : dia dos desafios
SKILLS --> GAME : desafios concluídos
GAME --> DONE : placar final
DONE --> [*]
@enduml
